flowchart TD
    A[Client Request] --> B{Path starts with /api?}

    B -- No --> P1[Skip token auth]
    P1 --> P2[RequestResponseLoggingMiddleware starts timer]
    P2 --> P3[Execute public endpoint or static response]
    P3 --> P4[Log method path status elapsed]
    P4 --> Z[Return response]

    B -- Yes --> C[TokenAuthenticationMiddleware]
    C --> D[Read Auth:ApiToken from config]
    D --> E{Token configured?}
    E -- No --> E1[Fallback to techhive-dev-token and log warning]
    E -- Yes --> F[Continue]
    E1 --> F

    F --> G{Authorization header present?}
    G -- No --> U1[401 Unauthorized JSON]
    U1 --> Z

    G -- Yes --> H{Header starts with Bearer ?}
    H -- No --> U2[401 Unauthorized JSON]
    U2 --> Z

    H -- Yes --> I[Extract incoming token]
    I --> J{Token equals configured token?}
    J -- No --> U3[401 Unauthorized JSON]
    U3 --> Z

    J -- Yes --> K[RequestResponseLoggingMiddleware starts timer]
    K --> L[Route execution in /api/users]

    L --> M{Endpoint selected}

    M --> M1[GET /api/users]
    M --> M2[GET /api/users/id]
    M --> M3[POST /api/users]
    M --> M4[PUT /api/users/id]
    M --> M5[DELETE /api/users/id]
    M --> M6[GET /api/users/trigger-error]

    M1 --> R1[Filter by department and isActive then return 200]
    M2 --> R2{Id valid and exists?}
    R2 -- No --> R2a[400 or 404]
    R2 -- Yes --> R2b[200 UserResponse]

    M3 --> R3[Validate fullName email department]
    R3 --> R3a{Validation errors?}
    R3a -- Yes --> R3b[400 Validation failed]
    R3a -- No --> R3c{Email already exists?}
    R3c -- Yes --> R3d[409 Conflict]
    R3c -- No --> R3e[Generate Id add user return 201]

    M4 --> R4[Validate request and load existing user]
    R4 --> R4a{Any validation or lookup issue?}
    R4a -- Yes --> R4b[400 or 404]
    R4a -- No --> R4c{New email owned by another user?}
    R4c -- Yes --> R4d[409 Conflict]
    R4c -- No --> R4e[Update user and email index return 200]

    M5 --> R5{Id valid and user exists?}
    R5 -- No --> R5a[400 or 404]
    R5 -- Yes --> R5b[Remove user and email index return 204]

    M6 --> R6[Throw InvalidOperationException]

    R1 --> N
    R2a --> N
    R2b --> N
    R3b --> N
    R3d --> N
    R3e --> N
    R4b --> N
    R4d --> N
    R4e --> N
    R5a --> N
    R5b --> N
    R6 --> X

    L -. exception .-> X[ErrorHandlingMiddleware catch]

    X --> X1{Response already started?}
    X1 -- Yes --> X2[Rethrow]
    X1 -- No --> X3[Clear response write 500 JSON]
    X3 --> N

    N[RequestResponseLoggingMiddleware logs final status] --> Z